{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2026/01/09/what-did-bowie-do-at.html","date":1767982251000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://supbowie.com/\">What did Bowie do at your age</a>?</p>\n<img src=\"uploads/2026/cleanshot-2026-01-09-at-09.56.172x.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"226\" alt=\"Image with the the text, He launched his own internet service provider, Bowienet. Bowienet included its own email accounts, forums, community blogs, interactive chat rooms and first dibs on all Bowie related content. Premium members could also pay to be first in line for tickets, and David Bowie himself engaged with fans in the chatrooms. Some high tech shit!\" />","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"2a2389254815bf52027b42249cd7095432248dbec5b3f5c568eef6292e8d66f1","category":"Sites"}